\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.2}{\ignorespaces Cross-tabulation of UPR and Emotional validation for r/aitah dataset. The figure illustrates the stark contrasts in traits of LLM-generated and human-authored responses.}}{26}{figure.caption.22}%
