\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.6}{\ignorespaces \textit {r/aitah}---Overall performance scores (Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1 Score) for OP-preferred responses and model outputs (GPT-4o, Claude, LLaMA, GPT-oss), comparing model baseline response with CoT dialog insertion. Values represent aggregate scores across the four classes, not per-class results.}}{30}{figure.caption.31}%
