\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.8}{\ignorespaces Deontic rate changes for r/anxiety responses with CoT dialog insertion. The figure illustrates how chain-of-thought prompting affects the frequency of deontic language (should/must/need/shall/ought) across different models.}}{32}{figure.caption.35}%
